SCI-Skills

This skill combines an original five-family, 35-stage paper collaboration
workflow supplied by the user with adapted workflow concepts from the
Apache-2.0-licensed nature-skills project by Yuan1z0825 and contributors.

The adapted material has been reorganized, renamed, condensed, and integrated
into independent expert skills for literature search, paper reading,
manuscript writing, academic polishing, scientific figures, statistical
reporting, paper presentations, pre-submission review, reviewer responses,
data availability, web data acquisition, authorial rewriting, and journal
recommendation.

The Nature name is not used as the product identity of SCI-Skills.
